You shook.
we gon' get you unshook.

509
00:31:50.732 --> 00:31:52.314
Get the fuck back to work!

510
00:31:52.414 --> 00:31:53.675
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

511
00:32:01.223 --> 00:32:03.345
You know
how this shit works. Garcia.

512
00:32:04.506 --> 00:32:06.668
You only as good
as your clearance rate.

513
00:32:08.070 --> 00:32:10.652
But shoe leather doesn't always
get the job done.

514
00:32:10.752 --> 00:32:12.654
Sometimes we have to wade

515
00:32:12.754 --> 00:32:15.557
into the very shit
that we tryin' to clean up.

516
00:32:17.719 --> 00:32:19.721
But that shit can stick to you.

517
00:32:20.482 --> 00:32:22.484
Can't always clean it off.

518
00:32:28.090 --> 00:32:30.332
Who were you talkin' to
about Shawn Figueroa?

519
00:32:31.893 --> 00:32:34.936
There's a quid pro quo
to this work.

520
00:32:35.897 --> 00:32:38.340
To get information.
you have to give information.

521
00:32:38.700 --> 00:32:40.682
And that's the choice
you have to make:

522
00:32:40.782 --> 00:32:43.625
"What do I know that feels
safe enough to share?"

523
00:32:44.946 --> 00:32:46.948
And that Figueroa kid felt safe.

524
00:32:47.589 --> 00:32:51.753
He dropped a stick-up kid
the whole neighbourhood hated.

525
00:32:52.994 --> 00:32:55.877
It felt like the safest
of the safe shit.

526
00:33:00.962 --> 00:33:02.744
I didn't know...

527
00:33:02.844 --> 00:33:04.846
they were gonna have him killed.

528
00:33:06.088 --> 00:33:08.150
And if they used police...

529
00:33:08.250 --> 00:33:09.551
they weren't from our precinct.

530
00:33:09.651 --> 00:33:10.792
Who made the call?

531
00:33:10.892 --> 00:33:12.474
Oh. some old-time gangsters.

532
00:33:12.574 --> 00:33:13.915
Barely even in the game anymore.

533
00:33:14.015 --> 00:33:15.837
I need a name.

534
00:33:15.937 --> 00:33:17.939
Shoo...

535
00:33:22.384 --> 00:33:24.506
Ishmael and Stephanie Henry.

536
00:33:25.827 --> 00:33:26.888
Snaps and Pop.

537
00:33:31.673 --> 00:33:32.975
Man. you got to believe me.

538
00:33:33.075 --> 00:33:35.797
I had no idea they was gonna
do that kid like that.

539
00:33:37.159 --> 00:33:39.641
And even now. I can't be
so certain that they did.

540
00:33:41.403 --> 00:33:45.767
They just had such a...
hard-on for that Raquel Thomas.

541
00:33:47.329 --> 00:33:50.032
Anything that tracked to her

542
00:33:50.132 --> 00:33:52.234
was something
they wanted to know.

543
00:33:52.334 --> 00:33:54.496
And I knew that
the Figueroa kid was...

544
00:33:54.896 --> 00:33:57.018
friends with
Raquel Thomas' son.

545
00:33:59.381 --> 00:34:00.242
So I threw 'em a bone.

546
00:34:02.944 --> 00:34:05.327
I had no idea

547
00:34:05.427 --> 00:34:07.429
it would end up how it did.

548
00:34:10.632 --> 00:34:12.634
The feds are all over this.

549
00:34:14.116 --> 00:34:16.258
- They're all over you.
<i>- I know.</i>

550
00:34:16.358 --> 00:34:18.360
I know.

551
00:34:19.441 --> 00:34:22.244
And it's far bigger
than Figueroa.

552
00:34:25.046 --> 00:34:27.048
It's Howard.

553
00:34:27.769 --> 00:34:30.332
It's Burke. It's the whole...

554
00:34:30.812 --> 00:34:32.814
<i>fuckin' ball of wax.</i>

555
00:34:34.896 --> 00:34:36.898
<i>You're about the only...</i>

556
00:34:37.219 --> 00:34:39.861
<i>clean cop in the 117. Garcia.</i>

557
00:34:43.305 --> 00:34:45.307
Take a fucking bow.

558
00:35:03.805 --> 00:35:05.827
They say that.
over time.

559
00:35:05.927 --> 00:35:08.030
losing someone you love
gets easier.

560
00:35:08.130 --> 00:35:10.372
but... that's horseshit.

561
00:35:12.694 --> 00:35:13.915
Time's only made me sadder.

562
00:35:14.015 --> 00:35:16.198
It's made me miss Shira
even more.

563
00:35:16.298 --> 00:35:17.879
So. fuck time

564
00:35:17.979 --> 00:35:20.302
and fuck all the people
that say it gets easier.

565
00:35:25.627 --> 00:35:27.249
You feel better

566
00:35:27.349 --> 00:35:29.351
after you took out the nigga
who killed your daughter?

567
00:35:34.276 --> 00:35:36.278
I didn't.

568
00:35:36.998 --> 00:35:38.260
And I don't regret what I did.

569
00:35:38.360 --> 00:35:40.342
but I don't feel any better.

570
00:35:40.442 --> 00:35:42.544
I don't miss my daughter
any less.

571
00:35:42.644 --> 00:35:44.266
But you got even.

572
00:35:44.366 --> 00:35:46.989
- Even's good.
- Even's gornisht. Marvin.

573
00:35:47.089 --> 00:35:49.471
Even is worse than losing.
It's nothing.

574
00:35:49.571 --> 00:35:51.313
It's nowhere. It's purgatory.

575
00:35:51.413 --> 00:35:54.256
We're not here playing for even.
We're playing to win.

576
00:35:55.977 --> 00:35:57.639
Look. what do I know?
I'm just some Jewish broad

577
00:35:57.739 --> 00:36:00.482
from the Upper East Side.
but if you ask me.

578
00:36:00.582 --> 00:36:02.524
your best and only chance

579
00:36:02.624 --> 00:36:04.626
at winning this thing
is your daughter.

580
00:36:05.587 --> 00:36:07.129
Go all in on her. Marvin.

581
00:36:07.229 --> 00:36:09.831
She's your pocket aces
and your silver bullet.

582
00:36:10.392 --> 00:36:12.654
Bet the fucking house on her.

583
00:36:15.437 --> 00:36:17.619
I get it.

584
00:36:17.719 --> 00:36:19.721
I know you do.

585
00:36:20.642 --> 00:36:22.644
L'chaim. Marvin.

586
00:36:23.245 --> 00:36:25.247
L'chaim.

587
00:36:28.450 --> 00:36:30.812
No one did more
to protect Raq than me.

588
00:36:31.453 --> 00:36:33.795
I mean. fixin' all the shit
she broke.

589
00:36:33.895 --> 00:36:35.998
buildin' back
the bridges she burned.

590
00:36:36.098 --> 00:36:37.399
But you-you-you can't
help someone

591
00:36:37.499 --> 00:36:39.481
that doesn't wanna help
themselves.

592
00:36:39.581 --> 00:36:41.123
And when they're drowning.
like she is.

593
00:36:41.223 --> 00:36:43.505
you gotta get as far away
as you can...

594
00:36:44.266 --> 00:36:46.268
or she'll drag you under
with her.

595
00:36:51.633 --> 00:36:53.935
She has not been
a reliable partner.

596
00:36:54.035 --> 00:36:56.058
She guaranteed me
a specific volume of demand

597
00:36:56.158 --> 00:36:57.219
that she has not met.

598
00:36:57.319 --> 00:36:59.621
Well. my young friend here.

599
00:36:59.721 --> 00:37:03.145
he can meet and surpass
those demands. Hafiz.

600
00:37:03.245 --> 00:37:05.107
And you won't get
all the bullshit

601
00:37:05.207 --> 00:37:06.588
that comes along with Raq.

602
00:37:06.688 --> 00:37:09.411
We movin' so much work right now
we can't keep up.

603
00:37:10.532 --> 00:37:12.554
What about
your current supplier?

604
00:37:12.654 --> 00:37:14.316
Well...

605
00:37:14.416 --> 00:37:16.418
We got enough room
for everybody.

606
00:37:16.738 --> 00:37:18.240
<i>And we gon' give you
a five percent bump</i>

607
00:37:18.340 --> 00:37:20.342
on what Raq has been payin'.

608
00:37:24.386 --> 00:37:26.408
Your friends in Manhattan

609
00:37:26.508 --> 00:37:28.950
won't like that we're abandoning
them and their business.

610
00:37:30.752 --> 00:37:32.694
I'll handle Pino.

611
00:37:32.794 --> 00:37:34.796
You don't need to worry
about that.

612
00:37:36.438 --> 00:37:38.660
<i>Why are you extending
this offer to us?</i>

613
00:37:38.760 --> 00:37:41.163
Surely you have relationships
with other importers.

614
00:37:41.603 --> 00:37:42.704
Unless you are doing this

615
00:37:42.804 --> 00:37:45.127
simply to undermine
Raquel Thomas.

616
00:37:48.130 --> 00:37:49.431
You ever hear the expression

617
00:37:49.531 --> 00:37:51.753
"Don't look a gift horse
in the mouth"?

618
00:37:51.853 --> 00:37:53.635
'Cause from where I'm standin'.

619
00:37:53.735 --> 00:37:55.717
you look like you got
a lot of horse

620
00:37:55.817 --> 00:37:58.700
and we're offering you
a hell of a gift.

621
00:37:59.181 --> 00:38:00.242
You should take it.

622
00:38:11.433 --> 00:38:12.654
- We accept.
- Ah!

623
00:38:12.754 --> 00:38:14.496
A wise decision.

624
00:38:14.596 --> 00:38:15.737
- Ah-ah.
- Mm-hmm.

625
00:38:15.837 --> 00:38:16.818
There you go. huh?

626
00:39:36.958 --> 00:39:38.960
I wanted you two
to meet

627
00:39:39.481 --> 00:39:42.224
because if anything
were to happen to me...

628
00:39:42.324 --> 00:39:44.326
What's gonna happen to you?

629
00:39:45.447 --> 00:39:47.349
I'm just saying.

630
00:39:47.449 --> 00:39:50.132
If anything happens.
I want you to know each other.

631
00:39:51.052 --> 00:39:53.115
I'm not plannin'
on goin' nowhere no time soon.

632
00:39:53.215 --> 00:39:54.556
but...

633
00:39:54.656 --> 00:39:56.658
nobody ever is.

634
00:39:57.259 --> 00:39:59.261
You step off that curb...

635
00:40:00.902 --> 00:40:02.904
...those buses move real fast.

636
00:40:06.348 --> 00:40:08.670
I don't want you to go anywhere.
Uncle Marvin.

637
00:40:09.070 --> 00:40:10.412
Don't worry.

638
00:40:10.512 --> 00:40:12.214
He got me.

639
00:40:12.314 --> 00:40:13.976
and I'll always be holdin'
his old-ass hand

640
00:40:14.076 --> 00:40:15.297
when he cross the street.

641
00:40:15.397 --> 00:40:17.479
My girls.

642
00:40:18.160 --> 00:40:20.162
All worried about me.

643
00:40:26.007 --> 00:40:28.850
Those police
still tryin' to scare you?

644
00:40:29.571 --> 00:40:31.573
They came by again.

645
00:40:32.454 --> 00:40:35.077
They said another neighbour
saw a Black guy

646
00:40:35.177 --> 00:40:37.859
coming out of the house
when that happened.

647
00:40:39.221 --> 00:40:40.962
They just lyin'. though.

648
00:40:41.062 --> 00:40:43.064
You didn't fall for that.

649
00:40:43.465 --> 00:40:45.547
I told them I wasn't sure.

650
00:40:46.108 --> 00:40:49.591
I was so scared. I couldn't
really remember for sure.

651
00:40:50.752 --> 00:40:52.054
Uh...

652
00:40:52.154 --> 00:40:53.975
Ah...

653
00:40:54.075 --> 00:40:56.138
Go play on them swings.

654
00:40:56.238 --> 00:40:58.340
Be over in a minute.

655
00:41:05.767 --> 00:41:07.769
What'd you do?

656
00:41:09.491 --> 00:41:11.473
Can't really get into it
right now.

657
00:41:11.573 --> 00:41:13.475
But it's on some "no good deed

658
00:41:13.575 --> 00:41:15.577
goes unpunished" type shit.

659
00:41:18.540 --> 00:41:20.482
Guess I'ma need you
to get that cop to look into it.

660
00:41:28.710 --> 00:41:30.972
We gotta hit the fuck back. man.

661
00:41:31.072 --> 00:41:34.016
That's my mom's shit
at my old spot:

662
00:41:34.116 --> 00:41:35.617
my uncle runnin' up like he did.

663
00:41:35.717 --> 00:41:37.819
We need to run up on that club.

664
00:41:37.919 --> 00:41:38.981
start blastin'.

665
00:41:39.081 --> 00:41:40.983
You wanna hit them
like you hit Krank.

666
00:41:41.083 --> 00:41:43.265
I made an example
out of Krank.

667
00:41:43.365 --> 00:41:45.367
I'ma make a meal out my mom.

668
00:41:46.648 --> 00:41:48.470
You gon' put down Raq?

669
00:41:48.570 --> 00:41:50.572
This ain't about
puttin' her down.

670
00:41:51.333 --> 00:41:53.335
It's about showin' her
who the fuck we are.

671
00:41:53.935 --> 00:41:56.798
And what the fuck that gon' do
for us and this work?

672
00:41:56.898 --> 00:41:58.680
She came at us.

673
00:41:58.780 --> 00:42:00.162
We goin' back at her.

674
00:42:00.262 --> 00:42:02.264
She came at you. nigga.

675
00:42:02.624 --> 00:42:04.086
Not us.

676
00:42:04.186 --> 00:42:06.048
This between y'all.

677
00:42:06.148 --> 00:42:07.809
The rest of us
just collateral damage

678
00:42:07.909 --> 00:42:09.851
in y'all bullshit.

679
00:42:09.951 --> 00:42:12.194
Look. there's a time and place
for everything.

680
00:42:13.074 --> 00:42:14.656
But we gotta be strategic.

681
00:42:14.756 --> 00:42:16.578
Can't just buck off.

682
00:42:16.678 --> 00:42:18.920
<i>You gotta measure and mark
a motherfucker</i>

683
00:42:19.481 --> 00:42:20.742
before you make your move.

684
00:42:24.806 --> 00:42:26.808
You heard?

685
00:42:34.136 --> 00:42:36.138
My decision is final.

686
00:42:36.498 --> 00:42:38.080
Well what happened to all of
that. "In my country.

687
00:42:38.180 --> 00:42:40.222
it's better to be dead
than break a promise" bullshit?

688
00:42:40.982 --> 00:42:42.284
'Cause you made a whole lot
of fuckin' noise

689
00:42:42.384 --> 00:42:43.765
about all that. Hafiz.

690
00:42:43.865 --> 00:42:46.888
We have found another partner
who offers

691
00:42:46.988 --> 00:42:49.551
increased demand
and a better price.

692
00:42:50.112 --> 00:42:52.114
So you fuckin'
with somebody else.

693
00:42:56.838 --> 00:42:58.060
Okay.

694
00:42:58.160 --> 00:43:00.342
But why that mean
you gotta dead our shit?

695
00:43:00.442 --> 00:43:02.444
I would never get in the way
of you gettin' paid.

696
00:43:04.086 --> 00:43:06.188
You can work
with the both of us.

697
00:43:06.288 --> 00:43:08.290
We cannot.

698
00:43:14.576 --> 00:43:16.578
You fuckin' wit' Stefano
and all of them.

699
00:43:17.619 --> 00:43:19.621
He makin' you kick me
to the curb.

700
00:43:23.385 --> 00:43:25.447
You must leave now.

701
00:43:25.547 --> 00:43:27.549
Let's go.

702
00:43:33.275 --> 00:43:34.616
You talk about how hard
motherfuckers are

703
00:43:34.716 --> 00:43:36.738
where you from. Hafiz?

704
00:43:36.838 --> 00:43:38.840
You don't know shit
about where I'm from.

705
00:43:40.322 --> 00:43:42.324
You about to find out.

706
00:43:46.968 --> 00:43:48.310
<i>Snaps and Pop.</i>

707
00:43:49.891 --> 00:43:51.893
They killed Fame?

708
00:43:53.095 --> 00:43:55.277
With some help from the police.

709
00:43:55.377 --> 00:43:57.039
Don't know which cops exactly.

710
00:43:57.139 --> 00:43:59.141
It wasn't Buckley and Roland.

711
00:43:59.461 --> 00:44:01.463
But it was NYPD.

712
00:44:02.144 --> 00:44:04.146
Just like I told you.

713
00:44:05.747 --> 00:44:07.929
Look. Uh...

714
00:44:08.029 --> 00:44:10.031
I don't know what made me think
I could do this with you.

715
00:44:11.913 --> 00:44:13.915
I can't.

716
00:44:18.360 --> 00:44:20.182
Here's the money you gave me.

717
00:44:20.282 --> 00:44:21.823
Every dollar.

718
00:44:21.923 --> 00:44:23.865
I'm done.

719
00:44:23.965 --> 00:44:25.507
Hearin' how all these other guys
are on the take.

720
00:44:25.607 --> 00:44:27.769
it makes me realise
that I'm not them.

721
00:44:30.212 --> 00:44:32.034
Assumin' you keep
your nose clean.

722
00:44:32.134 --> 00:44:33.955
I'll leave you alone.

723
00:44:34.055 --> 00:44:36.057
I won't bother you anymore.

724
00:44:36.818 --> 00:44:39.861
I don't want anything to do
with you or this.

725
00:44:48.150 --> 00:44:49.411
Barely knew what the fuck
I was doing

726
00:44:49.511 --> 00:44:51.513
with all this shit anyway.

727
00:44:54.716 --> 00:44:57.119
Yeah. that makes two of us.

728
00:45:01.483 --> 00:45:03.805
I do need one more favour
from you. Garcia.

729
00:45:04.446 --> 00:45:06.448
One last thing
for you to look into.

730
00:45:15.337 --> 00:45:16.598
It's not like I was planning
on doing this work

731
00:45:16.698 --> 00:45:17.959
for the rest of my life.

732
00:45:18.059 --> 00:45:20.061
This was always gonna be
a short stop for me.

733
00:45:20.862 --> 00:45:23.625
I don't know that you were
really ever cut out for it.

734
00:45:23.985 --> 00:45:25.407
And a big part of this job
is showing up.

735
00:45:25.507 --> 00:45:27.509
and that's clearly
not your strong suit.

736
00:45:29.511 --> 00:45:31.613
I appreciate the opportunity.

737
00:45:31.713 --> 00:45:33.855
Best of luck. Jarita.

738
00:45:33.955 --> 00:45:34.976
You too.

739
00:46:29.931 --> 00:46:31.933
You're lucky this rug is new.

740
00:46:57.399 --> 00:46:59.141
This don't feel right.

741
00:46:59.241 --> 00:47:01.323
How many more wars you tryin'
to have at the same time?

742
00:47:02.324 --> 00:47:03.665
As many as it take to win.

743
00:47:19.101 --> 00:47:21.163
What is this. you and Jarita
thought you could rob me

744
00:47:21.263 --> 00:47:22.724
or something idiotic like that?

745
00:47:22.824 --> 00:47:24.486
That's not what this about.

746
00:47:24.586 --> 00:47:26.588
Then what?

747
00:47:27.549 --> 00:47:29.551
You workin' with Raq.

748
00:47:30.152 --> 00:47:31.453
I got beef wit' her.

749
00:47:31.553 --> 00:47:33.495
And who the fuck are you
exactly?

750
00:47:36.278 --> 00:47:38.340
Her son.

751
00:47:38.440 --> 00:47:40.762
Oh. you gotta be
fucking kidding me.

752
00:47:50.692 --> 00:47:52.714
Don't have time for this.

753
00:47:52.814 --> 00:47:54.816
Ain't gonna take long.

754
00:47:56.858 --> 00:47:59.421
<i>When shit go bad.
it takes on a life of its own.</i>

755
00:48:01.022 --> 00:48:02.724
<i>Gets its own strength.</i>

756
00:48:04.226 --> 00:48:06.408
<i>Its own momentum.</i>

757
00:48:06.508 --> 00:48:08.770
<i>And once that happens.
you gon' run outta options</i>

758
00:48:08.870 --> 00:48:10.872
<i>real fast. nigga.</i>

759
00:48:11.713 --> 00:48:13.975
<i>You gon' make hard decisions
that's gonna hurt you</i>

760
00:48:14.075 --> 00:48:16.077
<i>and everybody around you.</i>

761
00:48:16.758 --> 00:48:18.960
<i>And once all that bad shit
start happenin'.</i>

762
00:48:19.801 --> 00:48:23.145
<i>you gon' think you can stop it
by doin' your own ill shit.</i>

763
00:48:23.245 --> 00:48:24.866
<i>But all that's gonna do
is give it more energy.</i>

